<title>USA: Pakistan buys Australian wheat, no U.S. - trade.</title>
<headline>Pakistan buys Australian wheat, no U.S. - trade.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-12-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pakistan bought 225,000 tonnes of Australian wheat during its weekend tender and no U.S. wheat, U.S. exporters said.</p>
<p>Price details were not available early Monday, but shipment was expected for December.</p>
<p>--Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720</p>
</text>
